    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/ebd244d60e7225ee5993a4db01889698.avif?t=1754679242\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ages of Cataria</strong>\u00a0is a cozy story generation game. Every story begins with a family embarking and then settling on a new land called &quot;Cataria&quot;. Here, the villagers will have to build out their comforts and find their roles in this new society.  <br><br>Over time, others will join your settlement, and some will find love and start new families around town. Experience these generational stories as your villagers age over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/55f9bb7e9362946ddaa977abbca76d43.poster.avif?t=1754679242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/55f9bb7e9362946ddaa977abbca76d43.webm?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/55f9bb7e9362946ddaa977abbca76d43.mp4?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/1771cb790ffd149a52a2dde895635917.avif?t=1754679242\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villagers will age before your eyes. In their lifetimes, they will leave a lasting mark on the village by forming meaningful relationships, experiencing life-changing events, and contributing their unique skills. See their children grow and leave their own unique mark on the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.poster.avif?t=1754679242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.webm?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.mp4?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/df4ce62fb350102f85155183cd5ae147.avif?t=1754679242\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build out your town, fulfilling your town\u2019s needs for shelter, food, and resources. As your town grows, so will its desires. Decorate your town to enhance its appearance, and villagers may start to take notice as well. <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.poster.avif?t=1754679242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.webm?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.mp4?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/cdab619e9bf496b16e7db61c38b51ea6.avif?t=1754679242\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every so often, villagers will encounter events around the village. These will pop up around the map and happen randomly, giving the villager a chance to experience a unique event. These events can be as small as finding a unique insect and as impactful as marriage.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.poster.avif?t=1754679242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.webm?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.mp4?t=1754679242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/9a20f944a9786ff201de6ec7f2403c55.avif?t=1754679242\" data-has-big /></div>Death is part of telling a generational story. Everyone\u2019s story eventually ends, and in Cataria, that is no different. Once a villager passes, their spirit will enter your town's spirit tree, which will grow with your town as more spirits pass away. This provides your villagers with a place to gather, remember their ancestors, and offer gifts to the afterlife.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/ecdb5a5fb8ba6b230a2d25fd4548bc90.avif?t=1754679242\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
